Acceptance Checklist
- No “vendor” label appears in app UI.
- A user can go Browse -> Sell -> Chat without role switches/settings.
- Listing cards consistently show poster name.
- Chat CTA disabled for SOLD/DELETED items and shows clear reason.
- Public profile preview loads from /api/v1/users/{id}/public.
- Conversation creation works using inquirer/poster fields.

Notes
- Backend is already aligned to the P2P dual-role model and passing tests.
- This file focuses on frontend behavior needed to prevent role-split perception.

